{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This trial version includes the following elements:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbTutorial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbEarly game story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb2 stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total playtime to clear is estimated at approximately 30 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A homeland defense adventure to raise and fight kawaii annihilation weapons!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Handheld annihilation weapons to defeat invading enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031430/extras/4b4ea5b4b0239e0b6328698c229cc222.poster.avif?t=1758919455\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031430/extras/4b4ea5b4b0239e0b6328698c229cc222.webm?t=1758919455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031430/extras/4b4ea5b4b0239e0b6328698c229cc222.mp4?t=1758919455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold MOCHI-O in your right hand, aim at the enemy, and attack. Enemies you defeat will drop seeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you accumulate experience gained from picking up the seeds, you will gain skills from random choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your MOCHI-O in battle to destroy the approaching enemies and defend the defense line.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Throwing Seeds to Breed MOCHI-O</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031430/extras/515cd08e81b42ceab240ff6f68461331.poster.avif?t=1758919455\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031430/extras/515cd08e81b42ceab240ff6f68461331.webm?t=1758919455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031430/extras/515cd08e81b42ceab240ff6f68461331.mp4?t=1758919455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend the money you earn in battle to strengthen MOCHI-O.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also unlock weapons, which will give you an advantage in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giving seeds to MOCHI-O will increase its trust level and strengthen its status.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is MOCHI-O?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031430/extras/1e6be370013baacf516366bc006394c0.poster.avif?t=1758919455\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031430/extras/1e6be370013baacf516366bc006394c0.webm?t=1758919455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031430/extras/1e6be370013baacf516366bc006394c0.mp4?t=1758919455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute hamster......but a handy annihilation weapon for homeland defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's mission is to raise MOCHI-O as a keeper and protect his country from foreign enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heartwarming dialogue between the characters is also a highlight of the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Creator Profile</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031430/extras/7140ceb35c1cab0edf3f56f5980a0c87.avif?t=1758919455\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zxima</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zxima started game development as an independent developer in 2017,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He has released 10 games, including \u201cParasite Days\u201d and \u201cPost-apocalypse Bakery\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His games are set in a tender post-apocalypse world, and feature game systems and a mysterious worldview created by his unique sensibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cCatastrophe Restaurant\u201d won the Top 3 award at the Google Play Indie Games Festival 2022.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Creator's comment]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wouldn't it be great if you could go on a rampage with a small, cute, and extremely strong character?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's what I had in mind when I created this game from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I would be happy if you could go on a rampage with a small, cute, and extremely strong character.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4031430?t=1758919455","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4031430?t=1758919455","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031430/1b8f057faf2bb8dcf74ea650ff3fd66c7a5c0b3c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758919455","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031430/1b8f057faf2bb8dcf74ea650ff3fd66c7a5c0b3c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758919455","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This trial version includes the following elements:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbTutorial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbEarly game story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb2 stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total playtime to clear is estimated at 